    "title": "Boonville survives late scare to take down Central - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ayden Crowley ,\n1 hours ago\nBOONVILLE, Ind. (WEHT) — The Boonville Pioneers held on to come away with a 59-52 win over the Central Bears. Senior guard Emily led the way for the Pioneers with 25 points.\nBoonville in back in action on Nov. 21 when it takes on Memorial. Central looks to bounce back on Nov. 22 when it takes on Princeton.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to Eyewitness News (WEHT/WTVW).",
